# dotnet build intermediates. The repo root's build-output patterns are
# anchored to the root (issue #33), so the rule lives beside the csproj that
# produces the output -- the same arrangement tools/hotreload-probe/ uses.
#
# There is no /bin/ here on purpose: Sim.csproj sends its OutputPath into
# client/Packages/com.ssalter.sim/Runtime/, and that output is COMMITTED. See
# the comment in Sim.csproj for why.
/obj/
